Really?

304
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:20,560
Yeah.

305
00:16:21,040 --> 00:16:22,040
I was more focused on

306
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:23,960
studying and internship during those years.

307
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,120
I seldom went to

308
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:26,520
the gatherings.

309
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:29,000
But I shouldn't have got his name wrong.

310
00:16:30,280 --> 00:16:30,920
Miss Liu,

311
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:33,160
if your friend has any problems

312
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:34,200
in the UK,

313
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:36,000
feel free to ask me for help.

314
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:37,960
Yaru,

315
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:40,640
Lawyer Guan has promised to help your friend,

316
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,520
why don't you toast to her?

317
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:44,280
Yes, Auntie.

318
00:16:46,640 --> 00:16:47,200
Lawyer Guan,

319
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:48,880
then this toast,

320
00:16:49,040 --> 00:16:50,800
I sincerely offer to you.

321
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:52,320
I'll drink first.

322
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:53,360
But there's one thing,

323
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:54,720
I can't drink hard liquor.

324
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:55,960
I'll try my best to block it for you,

325
00:16:56,880 --> 00:16:58,280
but there will be some I can't block,

326
00:16:58,920 --> 00:17:00,040
then it's up to you.

327
00:17:20,800 --> 00:17:21,960
Good things come in pairs.

328
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:23,640
This second cup

329
00:17:24,120 --> 00:17:26,880
is to let bygones be bygones.

330
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:28,720
If you don't drink it,

331
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:31,640
that means you don't forgive me.

332
00:17:45,080 --> 00:17:45,880
Excuse me.

333
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:47,440
I'll go to the bathroom.

334
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:48,480
Don't go.

335
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,120
There's a third glass.

336
00:17:49,120 --> 00:17:49,560
Enough.

337
00:17:52,320 --> 00:17:53,320
That's enough.

338
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:54,120
Ah.

339
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:03,600
Auntie Wen.

340
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:08,120
Remember.

341
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:09,760
No alcohol during the recovery period.

342
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:11,360
Otherwise, you may suffer from palpitations,

343
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:12,280
nausea,

344
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:13,040
and cognitive impairment.

345
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:14,280
I see.

346
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:16,000
Thank you, doctor.

347
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:48,840
Tian.

348
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:52,880
Jiming.

349
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:54,920
Jiming.

350
00:19:00,520 --> 00:19:01,160
Jiming.

351
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:02,280
Jiming, don't go.

352
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:03,960
Don't leave me.

353
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:05,760
Don't be afraid.

354
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:07,400
I'm here.

355
00:19:07,760 --> 00:19:08,240
Ah!
